    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>Make a Guile spell attack that burns an enemy within 5 squares and can leave it Frightened.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Main Action</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>Guile</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>One visible enemy within 5 squares.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Magic / Attack / Control</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>Make a Guile spell attack. You are the source of its Frightened condition.</p><dl class=\"hol-reference-outcomes\"><dt>Weak</dt><dd>3 fire damage.</dd><dt>Standard</dt><dd>3 fire damage and Frightened 1.</dd><dt>Strong</dt><dd>5 fire damage and Frightened 1.</dd></dl></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/24e545e6d860e8c1b03a21356fd22cae1c039785/design/cards/a-coal-for-a-promise.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/a-coal-for-a-promise.md</a> at <code>24e545e6d860e8c1b03a21356fd22cae1c039785</code>.</p></section>",
